[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Operating from the right side, by a screwdriver, and take the\nlight off.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Left number plate light</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236028\">F50</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Right number plate light</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236032\">F51</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018788.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>1.  If necessary, turn the light holder (1a) anticlockwisely, extract\nit and take the light off (1b).(Pressure clucht)</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018789.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that  the light and the\nlamp are not damaged.</p><p>If it the light has been taken off, reassemble\nit in the light holder.</p><p>Connect the electrical connetion.</p><p>Test the funcionality of the number plate\nlight.</p><p>Put the light in.</p>"]]